dy": "初めまして！\nお花畑さんの絵はとても可愛くて美しいです！！美男高校地球防衛部LOVE!の下呂阿古哉を描いていただきますのがいいですか？阿古哉ちゃんは美しい物が大好きだ美少年です。女装はいいです。可愛くて嬉しい絵がお願いします！御一考の程よろしくお願いします。どうもありがとうございます！！\n\nHello! Your drawings are so cute and beautiful! Thank you for sharing your work!!\nWould you mind drawing Akoya from Binan Koukou Chikyuu Bouei-bu LOVE? He is a very beautiful boy with long pink hair who loves beautiful things. I would be so happy if you would make him look cute and happy! He can wear feminine clothes if you like. It's up to you. Thank you so much for considering my request! Take care and thank you for all your hard work!!\n\nReference: https://imgur.com/a/GpmEoG8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mitsuma22737540/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a665af29/uploads/origins/4307dc76-8e4e-41fb-84a9-d16eeef62b9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d220ba75ccc80fe43054f11ce7614e5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a665af29/uploads/origins/4307dc76-8e4e-41fb-84a9-d16eeef62b9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d220ba75ccc80fe43054f11ce7614e5, https://si.imgix.net/a665af29/uploads/origins/4307dc76-8e4e-41fb-84a9-d16eeef62b9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e5bf767134a68dc664a8d317fe9d91e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a665af29/uploads/origins/4307dc76-8e4e-41fb-84a9-d16eeef62b9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c47835ea58d64159331f8833991dd61 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, Reo.\n\nI'd like to request an illustration for my avatar that I'm using in a game called VRC!\n\nYou can find detailed reference materials in the link below, but you can omit the accessories as you like, but I'd be happy if you could draw the headpiece anywhere.\n\nThe pose and background can be drawn as you like.\nThere are several looks such as clothes, so you can choose the one that is easy to write.\n\nIf possible, I'd like the character's layer to be separate from the background layer.\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nIdskY__Pfp2Xr4CvaldCmyQ-jvHnPTp?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mitsuma22737540/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/436e3417/uploads/origins/6bce7128-6b2d-46f7-8617-a42030fc4eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=084b2a99d800c9b4e7846a16e26ec8aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/436e3417/uploads/origins/6bce7128-6b2d-46f7-8617-a42030fc4eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=084b2a99d800c9b4e7846a16e26ec8aa, https://si.imgix.net/436e3417/uploads/origins/6bce7128-6b2d-46f7-8617-a42030fc4eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a051345f78b30a1ee27971cc8e64e4cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/436e3417/uploads/origins/6bce7128-6b2d-46f7-8617-a42030fc4eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac2838eab00949e445ad8a687782a159 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お花畑様はじめまして、新着イラストから釣られました( ´͈ ᵕ `͈ )♡\nご多忙中申し訳ありませんが、ぜひイラストを依頼したくリクエストしてみました。\n\n■キャラ\nhttps://sta.sh/21o7x05vph0v\n肌色と身長の差が分かるようになっていると嬉しいです。\n\n■内容\n中華風（デザインはお任せします）\n\n可能であれば納品はPSD・宛名などは別レイヤーでお願いします。\n受けるのが難しいようであればキャンセルして頂いて全然構いませんので、よろしければご一考お願いいたします( ´͈ ᵕ `͈ )♡", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mitsuma22737540/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84c0b795/uploads/origins/aceebacd-e94a-42c8-84b2-f11cfaa03a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=addf08b509cb70ab1881078d41cae941", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84c0b795/uploads/origins/aceebacd-e94a-42c8-84b2-f11cfaa03a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=addf08b509cb70ab1881078d41cae941, https://si.imgix.net/84c0b795/uploads/origins/aceebacd-e94a-42c8-84b2-f11cfaa03a53?bg=%23ff